                <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Caption" TagName="TagName.P" class="rz-text-secondary-color rz-mt-2 rz-mb-0">
                    Billed spend attributed to each customer's owning channel partner (Direct = account-owned).
                    @if (_spendAsOf is { } asOf)
